         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "ASTONISHED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I can lure special kitties whenever \\v[lore.title.seeker] ready.",
          "transl": "Ich können locken besonders Kätzchen, wann immer Seeker bereit."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "basin.shad-male-techie",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "When there, creature must be \\c[3]stunned to state of weakness\\c[0].",
          "transl": "Wenn auftauchen, Kreatur \\c[3]lähmen, um erreichen Schwächezustand\\c[0]."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "basin.shad-male-techie",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Then \\c[3]hit machine with attack of Shock\\c[0] for it to proceed with the capture.",
          "transl": "Dann \\c[3]treffen Maschine mit Schock-Angriff\\c[0], um starten Fangprozess."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "basin.shad-male-techie",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "However, \\c[3]capture easier when kitty health weakened\\c[0].\\. Keep in mind when kitty keep escaping.",
          "transl": "\\c[3]Fangen einfacher, wenn Kätzchen Gesundheit schwach\\c[0].\\. Dran denken, wenn Kätzchen immer abhauen."
